Low-Dose Naltrexone reduces symptoms in Stiff-Person Syndrome
Mauro Zappaterraa,b,⁎
, Elizabeth Shoused, Reed Loring Levinec
aSynovation Medical Group, Pasadena, CA 91105, USA
bDepartment of Physical Medicine and Rehabilitation, VA Greater Los Angeles Healthcare System, Los Angeles, CA 90073, USA
